cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MétaCan, cite the repository and the exact version or commit used."
type: software
title: "MétaCan: Canadian metaresearch frame and classifier pipeline"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-15
abstract: "MétaCan builds a provenance tracked Canadian research frame from a pinned OpenAlex snapshot, preserves four admission routes, records machine screening evidence, and applies a teacher imitation classifier to all 4,299,418 frozen works. Human classification accuracy has not yet been established."
